# Without a `mutation` line a child's genes are its parent's. Every budder
# descends from one whose `reach` is 9; budders die of age after a day, so by
# day 3 the founder and its first children are gone, and every budder alive,
# on either side of the chunk borders at x = 64 and y = 64, still has 9.
rules ../../packs/genes
seed 3
size 128 128
terrain water_level 0 rock_on_soil 0 rock_on_water 0   # flat soil everywhere
start budder at (62, 62) with (reach = 9)

run 3d
expect born budder > 20
expect died budder > 10
expect min reach of budder == 9
expect max reach of budder == 9
